{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the culture of the Huni Kuin indigenous people, the true people! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A classic 2D platform game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore each story in a 2D platform game full of obstacles and animals typical of the Amazon Rainforest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1064250/extras/8057a49252d22a6837d23d999a8f1d38.poster.avif?t=1761836377\" width=780 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1064250/extras/8057a49252d22a6837d23d999a8f1d38.webm?t=1761836377\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Different weapons and mechanics</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Respect the Yuxibu (Forest Great Spirit), play with bow and arrow, club or spear and discover the strength of Nixi Pae (ayahuasca) and Dume Deshke (rap\u00e9)!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1064250/extras/e1acda0de6ea098fc4f63a8392d68e79.poster.avif?t=1761836377\" width=780 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1064250/extras/e1acda0de6ea098fc4f63a8392d68e79.webm?t=1761836377\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Various bosses</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face powerful enemies such as the harpy eagle, the big owl, the scorpion king, the bridge alligator and many other fantastic animals and enchanted beings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1064250/extras/c64f45aa5192316e9cb163a169e96db5.poster.avif?t=1761836377\" width=780 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1064250/extras/c64f45aa5192316e9cb163a169e96db5.webm?t=1761836377\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Seven traditional stories to explore</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in the mysteries of the Enchanted Boa, the power of the vine (huni) and the leaf (kawa) and the secrets of the people of the forest!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1064250/extras/59ba9a51867f13aeb09bf486b19c605b.poster.avif?t=1761836377\" width=780 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1064250/extras/59ba9a51867f13aeb09bf486b19c605b.webm?t=1761836377\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Done together with the indigenous people</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow the stories through original drawings by the Beya Xin\u00e3 Bena group and listen to the narration in the Huni Kuin language itself, the H\u00e1txa Ku\u00ef!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1064250/extras/eb07a2cea245d7b5ee300f3b4113c898.poster.avif?t=1761836377\" width=780 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1064250/extras/eb07a2cea245d7b5ee300f3b4113c898.webm?t=1761836377\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1064250/extras/eb07a2cea245d7b5ee300f3b4113c898.mp4?t=1761836377\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game was made in partnership with the Beya Xin\u00e3 Bena collective, from the Kaxinaw\u00e1 Indigenous Lands of Rio Jord\u00e3o, in the state of Acre, in the Brazilian Amazon region, to provide an immersion in indigenous knowledge such as songs, drawings, stories, myths and rituals of the people.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The collective Beya Xin\u00e3 Bena (New Time Culture) was formed at the initiative of indigenous participants during the game's first workshop, in 2014, with the aim of gathering, promoting and disseminating audiovisual productions linked to the digital technologies of the Huni Ku\u0129 of Rio Jord\u00e3o. It is a collective of indigenous audiovisual productions.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1064250?t=1761836377","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1064250?t=1761836377","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1064250/ee75d8464ae121faba67d9bded08161c81d33486/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761836377","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1064250/ee75d8464ae121faba67d9bded08161c81d33486/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761836377","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,5],"notes":"The game is about an indigenous people and consequently depicts images in which they naturally do not wear clothes. Some of their legends and stories depicted in the game involve intimate romantic relationships."},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":2252740,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the culture of the Huni Kuin indigenous people, the true people! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A classic 2D platform game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore each story in a 2D platform game full of obstacles and animals typical of the Amazon Rainforest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1064250/extras/8057a49252d22a6837d23d999a8f1d38.poster.avif?t=1761836377\" width=780 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1064250/extras/8057a49252d22a6837d23d999a8f1d38.webm?t=1761836377\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Different weapons and mechanics</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Respect the Yuxibu (Forest Great Spirit), play with bow and arrow, club or spear and discover the strength of Nixi Pae (ayahuasca) and Dume Deshke (rap\u00e9)!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1064250/extras/e1acda0de6ea098fc4f63a8392d68e79.poster.avif?t=1761836377\" width=780 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1064250/extras/e1acda0de6ea098fc4f63a8392d68e79.webm?t=1761836377\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Various bosses</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face powerful enemies such as the harpy eagle, the big owl, the scorpion king, the bridge alligator and many other fantastic animals and enchanted beings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1064250/extras/c64f45aa5192316e9cb163a169e96db5.poster.avif?t=1761836377\" width=780 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1064250/extras/c64f45aa5192316e9cb163a169e96db5.webm?t=1761836377\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Seven traditional stories to explore</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in the mysteries of the Enchanted Boa, the power of the vine (huni) and the leaf (kawa) and the secrets of the people of the forest!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1064250/extras/59ba9a51867f13aeb09bf486b19c605b.poster.avif?t=1761836377\" width=780 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1064250/extras/59ba9a51867f13aeb09bf486b19c605b.webm?t=1761836377\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Done together with the indigenous people</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow the stories through original drawings by the Beya Xin\u00e3 Bena group and listen to the narration in the Huni Kuin language itself, the H\u00e1txa Ku\u00ef!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1064250/extras/eb07a2cea245d7b5ee300f3b4113c898.poster.avif?t=1761836377\" width=780 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1064250/extras/eb07a2cea245d7b5ee300f3b4113c898.webm?t=1761836377\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1064250/extras/eb07a2cea245d7b5ee300f3b4113c898.mp4?t=1761836377\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game was made in partnership with the Beya Xin\u00e3 Bena collective, from the Kaxinaw\u00e1 Indigenous Lands of Rio Jord\u00e3o, in the state of Acre, in the Brazilian Amazon region, to provide an immersion in indigenous knowledge such as songs, drawings, stories, myths and rituals of the people.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The collective Beya Xin\u00e3 Bena (New Time Culture) was formed at the initiative of indigenous participants during the game's first workshop, in 2014, with the aim of gathering, promoting and disseminating audiovisual productions linked to the digital technologies of the Huni Ku\u0129 of Rio Jord\u00e3o. It is a collective of indigenous audiovisual productions.</p>","developers":["Philosophical School of Games","Associa\u00e7\u00e3o Povos da Terra - APOTI"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1064250/b1fd205c1f2e4fcbd0a3ab8724bd800e484580a9/header.jpg?t=1761836377","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"All copyrights belong to Associa\u00e7\u00e3o Povos da Terra - APOTI<br />\r\nAll rights reserved \u00a9 2025 QUByte Interactive","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Quad Core<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 10.4<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Quad Core<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1064250/1206863302/18e80365119b7858971173d009115e091886995b/1761661354/dash_av1.mpd?t=1761661949","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1064250/1206863302/18e80365119b7858971173d009115e091886995b/1761661354/dash_h264.mpd?t=1761661949","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamsta